WEBVTT

00:00.850 --> 00:02.950
Most business opportunities hand

00:02.950 --> 00:03.510
you a binder.

00:03.510 --> 00:05.350
And wish you luck.

00:09.100 --> 00:10.540
Brango hands you a team.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.760
Companies hire all year.

00:14.860 --> 00:16.500
Most screen before they do.

00:17.340 --> 00:18.900
That's recurring revenue in a

00:18.900 --> 00:20.500
four-billion-dollar market.

00:21.280 --> 00:22.000
First,

00:22.520 --> 00:23.620
we build your brand.

00:24.180 --> 00:24.740
Your logo.

00:25.240 --> 00:25.700
Your website.

00:26.300 --> 00:27.200
Your toll-free number.

00:27.800 --> 00:28.940
Before your first call,

00:29.400 --> 00:30.900
your business already exists.

00:32.320 --> 00:33.540
Then we do what a

00:33.540 --> 00:34.400
binder can't.

00:34.760 --> 00:35.700
We get on your first

00:35.700 --> 00:36.900
sales demos with you.

00:37.500 --> 00:38.980
You learn on live calls,

00:39.380 --> 00:40.420
not from a manual.

00:42.140 --> 00:44.020
Behind you, we run the

00:44.020 --> 00:44.360
engine.

00:45.000 --> 00:45.960
White-label software.

00:46.900 --> 00:48.000
Vendor relationships.

00:48.700 --> 00:49.140
Compliance.

00:50.000 --> 00:51.000
Ongoing support.

00:51.720 --> 00:53.340
Your only job is growth.

00:56.810 --> 00:58.150
We've done this for over

00:58.150 --> 00:59.230
twenty-five years.

00:59.850 --> 01:01.170
Ninety-five percent of our

01:01.170 --> 01:01.950
partners stay.

01:05.100 --> 01:06.120
And when it's time to

01:06.120 --> 01:06.420
sell?

01:07.240 --> 01:09.100
Brango partners have sold for

01:09.100 --> 01:10.480
four to six times their

01:10.480 --> 01:11.320
yearly profit.

01:12.260 --> 01:13.880
We don't license to everyone.

01:14.460 --> 01:15.420
If you're built to grow,

01:15.820 --> 01:16.740
we'll build the rest.

01:17.360 --> 01:18.380
Book your call.
